Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯-博林阁下 蒙亨利国王圣恩浩荡 钦赐为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir thomas boleyn, you are by order and permission of his majesty, king henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗克福贵爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today created lord rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起身 爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arise my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利-菲茨罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry fitzroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利-菲茨罗伊 蒙亨利国王圣恩浩荡 钦赐为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry fitzroy, you are, by order and permissionf f his majesty, king henry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里士满\N{\fnArial\fs30}today created duke of richmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨莫塞特公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and of somerset,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兼诺丁汉伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and earl of nottingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起身 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arise, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红衣主教沃尔西阁下到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eminence, cardinal wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇后殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我见陛下的私生子获封公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see his majesty's bastard son is made a duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是意味着他是陛下的继承人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean he is next in rank to his majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地位仅次于国王？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next in line to the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至在我女儿之上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Above my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.47,0:03:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}律法意义上来说是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他比其他人地位都高\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is set above all others,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了… 嫡生王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for… a legitimate son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下深爱我们的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty loves our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在很多场合都流露过这种爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has shown it on many occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难以相信他竟然让自己的私生子 凌驾于我们的女儿之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe he wishes to place his bastard child above her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不相信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此举只是出自个人意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}was personally responsible for this action.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的女儿已经与罗马皇帝订婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}our daughter is engaged to the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原来王后娘娘未曾听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then your majesty has not heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝已经迎娶葡萄牙公主 伊莎贝拉为妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor has married princess isabella of portugal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很显然他觉得等待您的女儿长大 并不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently he decided it was not worth waiting for your daughter to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传言说他领悟到一个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is to say but perhaps he was influenced by the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美丽的伊莎贝拉公主的嫁妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the beautiful isabella brought with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:05:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一百万英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}a dowry of 1 million pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他违背了他的诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}He broke his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的王\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您示爱的赠品和暗示让我如此惶恐\N{\fnArial\fs30}How your tokens and signs of affection frighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我何德何能成为您心目中的女神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I be to you what you think me to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您清楚我只是一介布衣 无法与您的爱慕相配\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I am a commoner and I think myself unworthy of your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的馈赠和炽烈的诗句与眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thither offer of it and the passion of your majesty's words and looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}深深地触动了我的心和灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}touch both my heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「您用如此繁多如此精致的礼物 取悦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You have flattered me with so many and such wondrous gifts."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「请允许我献上我的回馈信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Allow me to send you this token in return, "
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虽然微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}"small though it is."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「却代表了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And allow me to remain, "
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}"in all things, "
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「永远爱慕您的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"your everloving servant."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安「\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Anne."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利 现在听我说 你就要拥有你自己的府邸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, henry, listen to me. You are going to own your own house now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会有很多的仆人 帮助你 照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have lots of servants to help you and look after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你要答应我做个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must promise me to be a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你身边的人体贴入微 仁慈宽厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and thoughtful and kind to those around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使你凌驾于他们之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be set above them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果你长成不可一世的样子 我会很伤心难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if I find you have grown too proud I will be sad and displeased.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 妈妈 我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, mama. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也答应你尽我所能去看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I promise I'll come and see you as often as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也相信你的府邸会非常宏伟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure your new house will be very grand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你 我的好儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, my darling boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.91,0:07:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得他们怀疑我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they were suspicious? Ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们当然怀疑过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they were suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你没有看见他的侍从们看你的眼神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you see the way his servants looked at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过他的儿子可是喜不自胜 我是说 国王陛下喜不自胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his son was overjoyed. I mean, his majesty was overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟 他苦等那座皇冠已经数年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, he had waited many years for the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老家伙在世时死拽着不放\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man had hung on grimly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些不用你跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need not tell me about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这还不够吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 哦 也是 也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Well, yes and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们最终还是要回到英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall come to england eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.65,0:08:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫁给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫁给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可怜的王妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My poor sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的的确确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇后的宝座才坐了几天 真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be made queen for just a few days. It seems incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让人伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她归来后服丧期间 务必受到舒适温暖的款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon her return she is to be treated to every comfort and kindness, while she mourns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于陛下您的离婚大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As to the great matter of your majesty's annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已与华翰主教筹建了一个教廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have set up an ecclesiastical court with archbishop warham.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以备商讨决策\N{\fnArial\fs30}to consider and decide on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都秘密进行 如蒙陛下恩准\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will meet in secret, if your majesty agrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保他们做出正确的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure they come to the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.09,0:09:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还有些纵深消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some further news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于罗马皇帝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经释放了弗朗西斯国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has released king francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}消息来源非常可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it on good authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以什么条件释放的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under what terms?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有待查实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have yet to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不与我磋商？我们是盟国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wasn't I consulted? We're supposed to be allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他葫芦里卖的什么药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he playing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉大使我要见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell his ambassador I want to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安 安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne! Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要对我说一番话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to say something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若你喜做我真实忠诚的情人和朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it pleases you to be my true, loyal mistress and friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就献出你的身体和灵魂 都给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give yourself up to me, body and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证待你为唯一的情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise I'll take you as my only mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.31,0:10:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会移情别恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't have a thought or affection for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若你同意做我的授爵情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you agree to be my maitresse en titre,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.03,0:11:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证只为你一个人效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise I shall serve only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}授爵情人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maitresse en titre?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您正式的情人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your official mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会得到你想要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will have everything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要在我王权之内 都是你的 只要你开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything within my power to give to you. It's yours, just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.53,0:11:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我造了什么孽 让您这样对我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I done to make you treat me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}造孽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做错什么了？你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What fault have I committed? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下我已决定将贞操献给我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty I have already given my maidenhead into my husband's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管他是谁 只有他才能拥有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whoever he is, only he will have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我清楚事情会怎样变坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I know how it goes otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐姐被大家称为「名妓」\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister is called "the great prostitute" by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.11,0:12:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉冒犯了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry if I offended you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非我本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我袒露我的真心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke plainly of my true feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}*****
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary. Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.95,0:12:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回你的房间 我随后就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your room. I will come later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再次拜访啊 主教大人 您可真是日理万机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another visit, your eminence!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下 好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I have some good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然国王陛下已经赐予领地给 皇子里士满公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since his majesty has given his son, the duke of richmond his own establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.51,0:13:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他深思熟虑之后觉得 他深爱的公主玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}he considers it only.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也应有此封赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}should also have hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿闻其详\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下有意送给公主 威尔士边界的拉德洛城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty intends to send the princess to ludlow castle in the welsh marches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她将由萨利斯贝利夫人悉心照料\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will be under the care of lady salisbury,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做她的教侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}her lady governess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的私人老师费瑟斯顿爵士 也将陪同前往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her tutor, dr. Fetherston will also accompany her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随行的还有300名公主的家仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with 300 members of the princess's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的女儿要离我远去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is to be taken away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非也 陛下赐予了她 一个公主真正的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. His majesty is according her the true honours of a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你的诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:14:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我常常担负莫须有的罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, I am often accused of things that are not my fault or responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.19,0:14:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些人惯于不明真相 不守真理就信口雌黄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people are always prone to speak evil without knowledge of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深恐他们的行为玷污了 王后娘娘对我的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear they may have poisoned your majesty's mind against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要夺走我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are taking my child from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My child!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把她从我身边夺去 就如同你曾把她从我子宫里夺去一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are tearing her from me, as if you were tearing her from my womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是奉陛下的命办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do as his majesty commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是我的仇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下此言差矣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty is unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我眼前消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至高至圣罗马帝国大使到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambassador of his highness the holy roman emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门多萨爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor mendoza,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见到你我很不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not pleased to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.26,0:15:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的主子违背了他所有的诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your master has broken all his promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.02,0:15:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他收了我们的钱 却反过来倒打一耙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has taken our money but used it against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他同法兰西国王背着我密谋单方面和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has negotiated a separate peace with the king of france.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.38,0:15:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和教皇大人 却疏忽了他的朋友和同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his holiness the pope while neglecting his friend and ally!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.99,0:15:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没有守约\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has not kept faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯对我只有三言两语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles has nothing but words for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对别人却是签约立契\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deeds he keeps for others!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王殿下不会背叛陛下 永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor would never betray your majesty. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他敬您为皇叔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He regards you as his uncle he.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狗屁皇叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}his fucking uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:16:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才多大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下也当考虑到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your highness must consider that you, yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您自己并未尽责\N{\fnArial\fs30}may not always have kept to your obligations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟 我们只收到承诺中黄金数量的一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, we received only half the amount of gold that was promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的指责完全是荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your accusations are totally false!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论和人与我抵触 我都将还之于人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will answer for my honourable conduct, whoever contradicts me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.48,0:16:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗彻福德阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王殿下对您的升迁传达最热烈的祝贺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor sends you his warmest congratulations on your elevation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王殿下为何关心我的升迁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does the emperor care about my elevation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他愿在英格兰宫中结友并为之献惠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cares to have friends at the english court and pays for the privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不已有朋友在其中吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he have many friends here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}些许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你将与他们结识\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这友谊将得何惠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does friendship pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每年一千克朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}1000 crowns a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我定会考虑殿下优裕的提案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will certainly consider his highness's gracious offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.55,0:17:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对西班牙国使感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how did you find the imperial ambassador?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令人心动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stimulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.00,0:18:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他是名极有原则的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find him a man of great principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈利路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确是哈利路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallelujah indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必 我只是在赏曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was just listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.48,0:18:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你禀赋非常\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have such a talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.31,0:18:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥菲斯恐怕也羡慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orpheus himself would be jealous, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.21,0:18:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安 威廉爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, sir william.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们也日安\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very good day to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不觉这音乐动人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't the music divine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 非常同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I quite agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir william.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 乔治 求你 还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, george! Please. Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已将心献于你 而我渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have given you my heart now I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 将身体也献于你 - 不要 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to dedicate my body to you. - Don't! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由全身心爱你坚贞不移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Written by the hand of him who in heart, body and will is your loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的奴仆亲笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and most ensured servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}H R 喔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}hr. Aw…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看 他在H和R之间还画了颗心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and look! He's drawn a little heart between the lett h and R.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:19:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想象一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰国王写信给我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}the king of england writing to my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说愿做她的奴仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}promising to be her servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是令人难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把信给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.07,0:20:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他爱上你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把信给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有爱上他 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in love with him are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.20,0:20:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要离婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants a divorce?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王要废除婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king wants an annulment on the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以他本就不该结婚为由\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was never married in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.28,0:20:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}娶他哥哥的妻子已经触犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By marrying his brother's wife he has offended the laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天条凡法\N{\fnArial\fs30}of both god and man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只是想得到承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}He simply wants that recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇特许了他娶凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pope gave him a dispensation to marry katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的确特许了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.53,0:20:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点无可质疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one denies it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:21:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但国王认为他对上帝所负责任 应该比他对教皇所负的要多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the king feels more beholden to god than he does to the pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.43,0:21:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的良知深受谴责并为之触痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}His conscience is genuinely stricken, and tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他违背了上帝的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has disobeyed god's injunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇无论如何言语如何行动 也改不了这一事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's nothing his holiness can say or do that can alter that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇是上帝在世间的代言人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pope is god's representative on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为上帝的口舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}He speaks for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 拜托了 托马斯 你在装什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come, come thomas. What are you pretending?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王一直离婚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kings get divorced all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇也总能找到借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}And popes always find an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你是理想主义者 但你也不是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're an idealist but you're not stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.05,0:21:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果亨利要废除婚约谁能拦住他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If henry wants an annulment who's to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你就事论事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. You talk of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也就和你就事论事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿拉贡的凯瑟琳不光是名伟大的皇后 是伟大先王的千金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine of aragon is not only a great queen and the daughter of great kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.11,0:21:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也受全国百姓的爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}she is also immensely popular throughout the whole of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.69,0:21:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王只为治愈良知而抛弃她也是上帝所不啻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forbid that the king should abandon her just to ease his own conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不觉得英格兰人民会原谅他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think the english people would ever forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.07,0:21:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她知情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she know yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她知道不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she know yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.77,0:22:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（朗伯斯教堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在钉着救世主的十字架下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold the cross on which hung the savior of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在钉着救世主的十字架下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold the cross on which hung the savior of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在钉着救世主的十字架下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold the cross on which hung the savior of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朗伯斯的善人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good people of lambeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这基督受难日 皇后陛下将为贫穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this good friday the queen's majesty will distribute alms to you unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.29,0:23:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却忠心耿耿的人们发放救济\N{\fnArial\fs30}but true and loyal subjects of their majesties…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以圣灵与慈爱的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the christian spirit of charity and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.51,0:23:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}God be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.12,0:23:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}*****
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保持信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}In good faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我恳求您 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, I beseech you, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.43,0:23:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要害怕 你是上帝的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not be afraid. You are god's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.33,0:23:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想验验我们的货吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna see our business?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.60,0:24:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.93,0:24:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的威廉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear william.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.76,0:24:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯 欢迎回来 见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, welcome back, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.92,0:24:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也是 来 坐下 喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too. Come, sit down, have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.25,0:24:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白 为何此处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't understand. Why here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.78,0:24:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都等着你回宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been expecting you back at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.57,0:24:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王尚安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.24,0:24:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}焦虑的等待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anxiously awaiting his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.13,0:24:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去安抚他悲伤的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}to share her grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.22,0:24:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.09,0:24:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.95,0:24:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她… 和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.87,0:24:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和… ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and…?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.72,0:25:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.88,0:25:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来了 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.99,0:25:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.11,0:25:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得告诉国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.87,0:25:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得告诉他？为什么是我去告诉他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell him? Why do I have to tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.94,0:25:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为从你口中听到会好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it'd be better coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.20,0:25:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么了 查尔斯？魂丢了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, charles? Have you lost your nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不是说笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.51,0:25:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你为什么要这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.16,0:25:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你了解我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.83,0:25:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有时候就是不思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't always think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.72,0:25:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.35,0:25:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只不过不是用脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not with your head! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.08,0:25:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利？你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry? You.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.36,0:25:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 我有话要对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}katherine, I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.09,0:26:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我看来 我们的婚姻已经结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I'm concerned our marriage is at an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.86,0:26:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上… 对于从未开始的事情也没有结束可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually… there is no need to end something which has never been.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我从未真正结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I were never truly married.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.68,0:26:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是对圣经的误读\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a misunderstanding of scripture.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.58,0:26:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和对圣典的滥用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a papal misapplication of canon law.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.67,0:26:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说真的我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true I…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.90,0:26:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前对此一无所知但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know about these things before but…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.79,0:26:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钻研之后我对其明朗起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it has been brought to light by learned opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.50,0:26:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并深深挫伤了我的良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it weighs down my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.65,0:26:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不完完全全放弃你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has forced me to give up your bed and board once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.86,0:26:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你唯一可做的选择是住到何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that remains is for you to choose where to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.25,0:27:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后尽快搬迁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to retire there as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.46,0:27:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.80,0:27:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是最好的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}all will be done for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.41,0:27:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尊敬的各位阁下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace, my lords…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.29,0:27:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你们已知晓我们为何再此密会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you know why we are gathered here, in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.63,0:27:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们奉陛下之令在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here at his majesty's bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.05,0:27:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下要求调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty has requested an inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.29,0:27:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他与阿拉贡的凯瑟琳的婚约之性质\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the nature of his marriage to catherine of aragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.09,0:27:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了安抚他的良知 治愈他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the tranquility of his conscience and the health of his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.81,0:28:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因利未记中有言：\N{\fnArial\fs30}For as it says in leviticus:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.28,0:28:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「人若娶弟兄之妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If a man shall take his brother's wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.64,0:28:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这本是污秽的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is an impurity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.17,0:28:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}羞辱了他的弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has covered his brother's nakedness,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二人必无子女「\N{\fnArial\fs30}they shall be childless."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.83,0:28:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下们 倘若此刻在我们之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if my lords, we are able to agree between ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.76,0:28:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能同意这婚姻原本并非合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the marriage was, in fact, never legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.33,0:28:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是违背了圣典与教会法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was proceeded with against both canon and ecclesiastical law.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.83,0:28:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下已深深忏悔然深信与其\N{\fnArial\fs30}as his majesty, to his great regret, has come to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.41,0:28:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我就理解为\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it is my understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.45,0:28:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为教皇使节\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, as papal legate,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.42,0:28:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己有权废除这起婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I myself have the power and authority to dissolve and end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.87,0:28:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然我非常愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course I would be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.86,0:28:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听听各位大人对此事的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hear the opinions of your lordships' on this great matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.54,0:28:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.04,0:28:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我倾向于同意主教阁下的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am inclined to agree with your eminence,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.01,0:28:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管在知晓详情前我保留看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}though I reserve judgment until I have heard all opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.24,0:28:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}费舍二阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.34,0:29:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我看来国王没有丝毫过失 丝毫没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see no merit in the king's case, so expressed. None whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.25,0:29:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使国王的婚姻上有障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was any obstacle to the king's marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.65,0:29:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也已被教皇的赦免令消除\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it was overcome by the pope's dispensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.57,0:29:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此婚姻当为合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The marriage was therefore legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.66,0:29:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而主教大人您也知道 教会是不允许离婚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as your eminence knows, divorce is disallowed by the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.66,0:29:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的观点就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.16,0:29:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.28,0:29:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索尔兹伯里夫人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady salisbury's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.46,0:29:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.52,0:29:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我带您的千金来道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have brought your daughter to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.53,0:29:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.29,0:29:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下大可安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty must be reassured.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.60,0:30:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会好好照顾公主 以符合她的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}The princess will be well taken care of, as befitting her station.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.91,0:30:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会将她身心造诣定时禀报于您\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be sent regular reports of her health and accomplishments.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.45,0:30:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然您也可在巡游时探访她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And naturally you will visit her during the course of your majesty's progresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.49,0:30:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要让她悉心习乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must make sure she practices her music.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.90,0:30:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在音乐上有天资\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a great facility for music.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.56,0:30:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女儿你要坚强 记住你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}BE STRONG MY DAUGHTER, REMEMBER WHO YOU ARE.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.22,0:30:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡斯蒂亚的费迪南德与伊莎贝拉的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}THE DECEENDENT OF ISABELLA AND FERDINAND OF CASTILLE.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.63,0:30:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰国王的独女\N{\fnArial\fs30}THE ONLY DAUGHTER OF THE KING OF ENGLAND.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.09,0:30:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要坚强 要踏实 然后总有一天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}BE STRONG, AND BE TRUE AND ONE DAY…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.94,0:30:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总有一天你会成为女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}ONE DAY YOU WILL BE QUEEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.17,0:30:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.08,0:31:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他内疚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.68,0:31:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他懊悔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he repent it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.46,0:31:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 他有没有乞求我的宽恕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me! Does he beg my forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.57,0:31:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您应该了解他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty knows his grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.95,0:31:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说他没有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean he does not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.24,0:31:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传我妹妹进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send in my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.26,0:32:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你未着黑色\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not wearing black.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.60,0:32:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.73,0:32:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你应该服丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are in mourning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.20,0:32:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的丈夫死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.39,0:32:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说你的丈夫死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said your husband is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.76,0:32:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.54,0:32:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的丈夫还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.12,0:32:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有准许你下嫁布兰顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you no permission to marry brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.50,0:32:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也永远不会准许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor would I ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.15,0:32:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您许诺过我 我可以自由选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me your promise! I was free to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.22,0:32:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有许诺过 是你搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made no promise! You are mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.02,0:32:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还敢直视我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you look at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.44,0:32:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是你的王 是你的主子 不是你的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your lord and master not your brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.37,0:33:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两个将被逐出宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are both banished from court.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.27,0:33:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在伦敦的住所将被剥夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will relinquish your london houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.33,0:33:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你从我眼前消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will remove yourself from my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.60,0:33:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.73,0:33:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.12,0:33:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.83,0:33:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 玛格丽特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And margaret?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.98,0:33:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.05,0:33:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还没决定是否该砍掉你床伴的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have yet to decide whether to make your bedmate a head shorter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.35,0:34:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说你想要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.91,0:34:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说你想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.75,0:34:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已为人夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.23,0:34:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.71,0:34:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.31,0:34:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么拒绝我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why deny me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.70,0:34:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.28,0:34:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仅仅如此吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.05,0:34:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.72,0:34:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是如此的美丽 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so beautiful, tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.92,0:34:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你贵为主子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.21,0:34:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.44,0:34:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}A genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.67,0:35:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.56,0:35:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有包裹送到 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}A parcel, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.80,0:35:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.15,0:35:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安-博林女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lady anne boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.80,0:36:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一个女人站在甲板上的船 船代表了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ship with a woman on board. What is a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.93,0:36:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}船代表了「保护」\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ship is protection,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.29,0:36:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}犹如方舟保护着诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the ark that protected noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.38,0:36:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么钻石呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The diamond?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.34,0:36:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「玫瑰传奇」里面是怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it say in the roman de la rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.41,0:36:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「一颗如钻石般坚固的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A heart as hard as a diamond,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.58,0:36:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忠贞不移…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"steadfast…"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.19,0:36:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恒久不变「\N{\fnArial\fs30}"never changing."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.53,0:36:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就是钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.71,0:36:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我就是那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.43,0:36:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她应允了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.52,0:36:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯国王迫切的想和 陛下您修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}King francis is eager for a rapprochement with your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.59,0:36:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他因新罗马皇帝对您弃信忘义 的行为感到厌恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is disgusted at the treacherous behaviour of the emperor towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.73,0:36:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他本人也因此行为深受其害\N{\fnArial\fs30}behaviour he knows only too well having suffered it himself at first hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.88,0:37:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且提议与您建立真诚而长期的友谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and offers you instead a true and lasting friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.84,0:37:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.83,0:37:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新罗马帝国皇帝背叛了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}the emperor has betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.74,0:37:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许他从一开始就没有以诚相待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps he was never sincere in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.55,0:37:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他甚至还有亲信戍守宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so, he still has friends at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.72,0:37:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.29,0:37:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我手下的探子截到这封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}My agents intercepted this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.20,0:37:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由皇后所写的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The letter is from the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.54,0:37:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她询问新罗马皇帝为何 未能多些写信给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She asks why the emperor doesn't write to her more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.55,0:37:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且许诺 一如既往的做他真诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And promises, as always, to be his true.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.59,0:37:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而卑微的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and humble servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却不是我的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.86,0:38:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟法国大使说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the french ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.75,0:38:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有与弗朗西斯国王 修好的意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we are in the mood for a rapprochement with king francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.46,0:38:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他派代表过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to send delegates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.11,0:38:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们联手与圣罗马帝国抗衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us be allies against this emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.36,0:38:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.33,0:38:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恳求得到你的处女之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lay claim to your maidenhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.54,0:38:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要向您许诺：\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I make you this promise:
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.19,0:38:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们成婚之时 我会为您生下子裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we are married, I will deliver you a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.42,0:39:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.12,0:39:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经珍惜你的处女之身 耐心等待到新婚之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall honour your maidenhead until we are married.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.18,0:39:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了爱 何事我不可为？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No less can I do for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.93,0:39:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.85,0:39:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.98,0:39:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日复一日您让我领略\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by daily proof you shall me find,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.78,0:39:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的爱之深 惜之切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be to you both loving and kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.59,0:40:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.15,0:40:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说过一切都没事 你说他会相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it would be alright! You said he would believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.27,0:40:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是你说的 那是你所保证的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you said! That's what you promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.11,0:40:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝仁爱的份上 我的妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of god, wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.52,0:40:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别叫我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想做你的妻子 我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be your wife. I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.46,0:40:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你不恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.99,0:40:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.88,0:40:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不是因为你 我依旧还是葡萄牙的皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for you I would still be the queen of portugal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.56,0:40:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我成了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now what am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.07,0:40:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喝多了 你在犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are drunk and you are foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.88,0:40:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利会原谅我们 他不过是在维护自己的尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry will forgive us. He is just standing on his pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.98,0:40:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只不过伤害了他的虚荣心 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wounded his vanity. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.84,0:40:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.34,0:40:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么我该相信你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.87,0:41:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不知道你是真的勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you're really brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.13,0:41:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是该死的蠢到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if you're just a fucking fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.52,0:41:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.17,0:41:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.30,0:41:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you, alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.63,0:41:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你和沃尔西谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've talked to wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.08,0:41:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也知道你并不赞同我要做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you do not approve of what I am trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.62,0:42:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}违背了你的良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's against your conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.43,0:42:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不会试图改变你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna try and change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.45,0:42:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎样 这一招都是不可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's unlikely, in any case.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我需要你明白 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to understand, thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.38,0:42:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要跟你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.01,0:42:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直和我的兄嫂住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been living with my brother's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.29,0:42:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我渐渐意识到他们的婚姻 言正其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have come to believe their marriage was consummated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.25,0:42:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果真得如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.70,0:42:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我一直都活在罪孽之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I have been living in sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.15,0:42:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能体会那种感受吗 托马斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you understand what that feels like, thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.30,0:42:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是为何我让主教大人验证此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why I asked the cardinal to examine the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.88,0:42:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果能证明教皇的安排 并无差池该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if it can be proved that the pope's dispensation was valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.45,0:42:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样就无罪孽可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that there was no sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.84,0:43:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我就是人世间最幸福的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I shall be the happiest man alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.25,0:43:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将满心欢喜的与凯瑟琳携手终老\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be content to live with catherine until the end of my days.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.46,0:43:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.83,0:44:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再次问您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.49,0:44:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果国王如此饱受良心的谴责\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the king is so troubled by his conscience,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.55,0:44:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么要等到现在才提出这个问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why has he waited so long to bring this matter to a head?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.20,0:44:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出于他对皇后的爱 他一直都在自我否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of his love for the queen, he has denied the truth to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.46,0:44:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是她无法为他产下子裔 这就是证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}But her failure to produce a living son, is proof of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.09,0:44:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想再婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he wants to remarry?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.66,0:44:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他的婚姻被注销无效 那么 是的 他会再婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If his marriage is annulled, then yes I am certain he will remarry,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.43,0:44:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从而生下继位者\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the hope of producing an heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.25,0:44:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经有继位者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has an heir!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.78,0:44:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一刻也无法相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.22,0:44:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰人民会认同私生子 为合法继位人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the english people will accept his bastard son as a legitimate heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.23,0:44:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连国王也不会认同\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nor does the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.81,0:44:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有一个名正言顺的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a legitimate daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.69,0:45:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.19,0:45:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰历史上已经充斥了那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}english history is littered with the tragedies.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.85,0:45:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传位给女儿的王者悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of those who have tried to pass on their crown to a daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.09,0:45:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.62,0:45:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可否已经有新妻子的人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has a new wife in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.19,0:45:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他有意娶一女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a mind to take one, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.89,0:45:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下流\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.72,0:45:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为你还是小心言语 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should be careful, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.20,0:45:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也该注意言行\N{\fnArial\fs30}As should you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.24,0:45:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人 拥有一间图书馆的好处之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the great advantages of having a library, your eminence,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.04,0:45:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是藏书万卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that it is full of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.83,0:45:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中一些书里记录着神法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some of these books contain ecclesiastical law.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.76,0:45:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据那些书的内容 你无权干预此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And according to those books you have no authority to judge this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.79,0:45:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事只能由教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is for the pope alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.13,0:45:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是由他亲典的人处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is for the pope alone or those whom he appoints.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.76,0:45:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人 这样看来 您已经超越了自己的职权\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that in this case, your eminence, your reach has exceeded your grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.16,0:46:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经邀请法国代表 来陛下的皇宫拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I have invited a french delegation to visit your majesty's court,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.05,0:46:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讨论两国联合\N{\fnArial\fs30}to discuss a new treaty,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.03,0:47:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共同与新罗马帝国拒绝合作 咄咄逼人而抗衡的新条约的事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}binding us together in the face of the emperor's intransigence and aggression.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.42,0:47:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.53,0:47:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然新罗马皇帝诋毁了 与玛丽公主的婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since the emperor has reneged on his promise to marry your daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.60,0:47:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许从政治角度考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could perhaps be politic.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.64,0:47:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该重新考虑将玛丽公主下嫁法国皇太子一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to resurrect her betrothal to the dauphin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.91,0:47:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果皇太子已经有了婚约 那就应该考虑弗朗西斯国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if the dauphin has already promised, perhaps to the duke of orleans,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.48,0:47:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最年幼的儿子奥尔良公爵为人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}king francis's youngest son.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.79,0:47:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的秘密会议进行如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of your secret sessions?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.27,0:47:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们可否有所定夺？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have they come to a decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.76,0:47:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要等到何事才能解除我的婚姻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How soon can I expect my annulment?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.61,0:47:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下不该多虑 但是 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty should not be concerned but uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.66,0:47:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还未能达成共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were not able to come to a conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.34,0:47:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}未能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not able?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.15,0:47:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事可为难事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The matter is a complex one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.30,0:47:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的？何以？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.09,0:47:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请赎鄙人多虑 我认为已经将此事 通报给教皇圣人克莱蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my considered opinion that we should apply to his holiness, pope clement.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.97,0:47:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由他来定夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a ruling on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.54,0:47:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您一直深得其爱 我敢肯定他定会随了您的心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since he loves your majesty I am certain he will rule in your favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.03,0:48:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.87,0:48:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I certainly do hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.05,0:48:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在你的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.43,0:48:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一眼就能认出法国人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can always tell the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.07,0:48:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是的 那群小白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. The ponces.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.29,0:48:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们做过的最聪明的事 就是买通沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never did anything so clever as giving wolsey a pension.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.08,0:48:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从未让他们失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never failed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.89,0:48:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须静观其向\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.85,0:48:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时机之轮运转到顶峰之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the wheel of fortune has reached its zenith,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.67,0:48:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事态发展的方向就只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is only one way for it to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.90,0:48:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯-哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.43,0:49:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让路 让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move aside! Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.95,0:49:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我带来了最重要的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bring most important news!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.19,0:49:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 罗马已经被攻下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty! Rome has been sacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.82,0:49:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him through!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.04,0:49:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 赎我给你带来最可怕和不幸的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, I bring most terrible and calamitous news.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.66,0:49:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马已经被德国和西班牙的圣罗马帝国雇佣兵攻下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome has been captured and sacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.89,0:49:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并洗劫一空\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the german and spanish mercenaries of the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.88,0:49:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们抢掠并侮辱了那里的教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have plundered and befouled its churches,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.29,0:49:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摧毁了圣徒遗物及圣宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroyed its relics and holy treasures,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.11,0:49:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}折磨并杀害了几千名传教士\N{\fnArial\fs30}tortured and killed thousands of its priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.24,0:49:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇圣人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of his holiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.13,0:49:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇被囚禁在圣天使堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pope is a prisoner in the castel sant'angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.52,0:49:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他成了新罗马帝国皇帝的监下囚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the emperor's prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.25,0:50:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.26,0:50:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布朗特女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady blount.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.08,0:50:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他染上了汉热病\N{\fnArial\fs30}He caught the sweating sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.94,0:50:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.57,0:50:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今早他就说不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}He complained this morning of feeling ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.78,0:50:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚间时 就已经归西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By this evening he was in the hands of god.
